, -0.05657, -0.0302, 0.139627, -0.280909, 0.825556, -0.477395, -0.323871, 0.08088, 0.48137, 0.033449, -0.724668, 0.067315, -0.079581, -0.261113, 0.339159, 0.379526, 0.099079, -0.406378, -0.815188, 0.334755, 1.392006, -0.473635, 0.037625, -0.123851, -0.130963, 0.124233, -0.410795, 0.066576, -0.443098, -0.159952, -0.823252, 0.724057, -0.197369, -0.301058, 0.190421, 0.173003, 0.14349, -0.099746, -0.49851, 0.386571, -1.778376, 0.068959, 0.896667, -0.804541, -0.601942, -1.189586, -0.119878, 0.233054, 0.272473, -0.233683, 0.349598, 0.108185, 0.61681, 0.401497, -0.19975, 0.893798, 0.343007, -0.733638, -0.354189, 0.02303, 0.185741, -0.043954, -0.656173, -0.552498, -0.129269, 0.012428, 0.269038, -0.807155, 1.258829, -0.438834, -0.636054, 0.165501], "label": 0}
{"stype": "Paragraph", "agent": "M5", "tr": "\"카메라는 자율주행자동차가 기본적으로 갖추어야 할 요건이다. 모노카메라는 사람이 한쪽 눈을 가린 듯한 기능을 한다. 즉 이 카메라로는 공간을 감지하는 데에도 제한이 있고, 확보할 수 있는 시야도 150m 밖에 되지 않는다. 하지만 보쉬의 운전자보조시스템 생산 매니저 토마스 클라센에 따르면 “대신 이 카메라는 특이사항, 예를 들면 보행자, 교통표지판 혹은 타 차량 등을 감지할 수 있다.“\"", "doc_org": "\"Kameras sind eine Grundvoraussetzung für autonome Fahrzeuge. MONOKAMERAS funktionieren, als ob sich ein Mensch ein Auge zuhält. Sie bilden die Umwelt also nur begrenzt räumlich ab und haben nur eine Reichweite von 150 Metern. Dafür bemerken sie charakteristische Bildausschnitte: «Einen Fußgänger, Straßenschilder oder Fahrzeuge kann sie gut wiedererkennen», erklärt Thomas Classen, Leiter Produktmanagement für Fahrerassistenzsysteme bei Bosch.\"", "doc": "T2", "embedding": [0.066779, -0.069132, -0.188335, 0.247055, -0.050812, -0.58715, -0.353469, -0.338221, 0.018051, -0.08364, -0.227385, 0.441754, 0.085376, -0.430063, -0.311707, 0.002161, -0.580277, 0.256918, 0.263134, -0.070197, -0.033896, -0.697099, 0.02067, -0.541233, 0.929112, -0.131767, 0.696922, 0.926178, 0.356573, -0.212896, 0.294145, -0.066311, 0.417254, -1.213865, -0.286344, 0.684801, -0.6537, 0.57398, 0.361347, -0.157322, -0.236465, -0.452101, -0.002687, -0.240532, -1.152686, 0.473543, -0.13204, 0.217998, 1.247323, -0.354277, 0.770565, 0.246423, 0.721251, -0.330007, -0.42598, -0.162081, -0.195111, -0.215903, 0.177675, 0.220403, -0.670774, -0.173289, -0.099347, -0.11327, 0.358743, 0.295504, 0.677404, -0.120791, 0.552237, 0.778858, 0.565632, -0.239195, -0.17865, -0.763664, -0.498561, -0.31612, 0.098745, 0.640536, 0.287245, -0.34299, 0.2678, -0.333848, -0.321826, 0.470483, 0.395394, 0.673483, -0.16621, -0.091928, -0.028614, 0.28106, -0.123066, -0.063232, -0.027317, 0.593571, 0.0977, 0.651989, -0.801676, 0.14105, 0.589277, -0.285674, -0.410276, 0.593834, -0.660265, 0.573625, 0.390363, 0.16392, -0.178559, 0.069961, -0.172211, -0.873386, 0.220694, 0.38874, 0.614799, -0.425265, -0.282868, 0.138803, -0.113245, 0.376332, -0.111391, 0.470841